      "note": "Dating is unsettled: Harappa.com gives a 7000 BCE site; UNESCO gives the excavators' Aceramic Neolithic c. 6500-6000 BC; a PMC article says as early as 8500 BCE. Start -6999 is 7000 BCE; range -8499 to -6499. End is UNESCO's Chalcolithic c. 3500-2500 BC."
